8,Foja Range languages - Wikiwand,https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Tor-Kwerba_languages,"The Foja Range languages, or Tor-Kwerba in more limited scope, are a family of about two dozen Papuan languages. They are named after the Foja Mountains of west...",Kwerba,Tor-Kwerba
